<body>
<div class="container">

<div class="portal-back-bar">
  <a href="/portal/dashboard">&larr; Back to portal</a>
</div>

<div class="meta">Engagement Proposal<span>&middot;</span>Cody A Smith LLC<span>&middot;</span>May 22, 2026</div>

<h1>Jason and Kevin,</h1>
<p class="intro">After our call, I sat with your family of companies, your sites, and the market you sell into. Here is the engagement I recommend, the real numbers behind it, the order it rolls out in, and a clean way to start today.</p>

<h2>What I see in your business</h2>

<p>You run three companies. <strong>F3 Properties</strong> is the real estate brokerage your family built up over twenty-plus years. It is online but visibly broken right now: the styling fails to load on most pages, and the magazine feature and the Brigadier General's endorsement that should be doing PR work for you are buried in the file directory where almost nobody finds them. <strong>Raised Bar Builders</strong> is the general contracting practice carrying three generations of your family's name, your grandfather's work in South Dakota in the 1920s, your father Wayne's decades in the Wood River Valley, your three companies now. It has no web presence at all. <strong>Raised Bar Development Group</strong> is the investment and acquisition arm; you said it stays behind the scenes, and that is how I treat it.</p>

<p>And you have <strong>Tailwater</strong>, three customized ZipKit Homes plans on an infill parcel in downtown Hailey, two blocks from Main Street, on a city park that already pulls foot traffic. You and Kevin want to pre-sell those three homes, and the location plus the ZipKit Homes finish give you something most luxury pre-sells do not have: a real story.</p>

<p>Your urgency is Tailwater. Your growth is Raised Bar Builders, especially with the ZipKit Homes authorized builder-dealer alliance Sven and Hayden have been building with you. Your maintenance priority is F3, the brokerage you said you want tightened up but is no longer where your energy is. That is the order I treat them in.</p>

<h2>What I recommend</h2>

<p>Two products. <strong>Web Management</strong> keeps your sites running, secure, and improving every month, billed per site, with hours pooled across the sites I manage for you. <strong>Marketing Consulting</strong> is research and strategy applied to the whole business: market, competitors, search and content, brand. I never execute on the marketing side. You give me direction, I come back with strategy. Sold once for the family of companies, never multiplied per site. Buy one, the other, or both.</p>

<p>For the build side I recommend the Raised Bar Builders site as the primary, with the F3 Properties takeover as a second managed site. Tailwater can live as a focused section inside the Builders site (the simpler rollout) or as a standalone pre-sell micro-site on its own URL (the harder push for the parcel signage and ads). Both options are below; the numbers update as you pick.</p>

<h2>Step 1: Pick a Web Management level</h2>

<p>Good, Better, or Best for Web Management. The level sets how often I update your sites, how fast I respond when something breaks, and how many hands-on hours per month sit in your pool. Marketing Consulting is a separate decision farther down the page. Pick management first, then the site setup, then decide if you want consulting on top.</p>

<div class="tiers">

  <div class="tier" data-tier="good">
    <h3>Good</h3>
    <div class="tagline">A start, intentionally light.</div>
    <div class="price-monthly">$534.60 &ndash; $772.20<span class="suffix"> / month</span></div>
    <div class="price-onetime">depending on Step 2</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Web Management for the Raised Bar Builders site and the F3 Properties takeover. Sites stay online, secure, monitored, and updated monthly.</li>
      <li>About 5 to 8 pooled hours per month for hands-on site work, depending on Step 2.</li>
      <li>Hosting, daily backups, security and uptime monitoring on every site I manage for you.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tier recommended" data-tier="better">
    <div class="pill">Recommended</div>
    <h3>Better</h3>
    <div class="tagline">The flagship. The right fit for what you are doing right now.</div>
    <div class="price-monthly">$894.60 &ndash; $1,292.20<span class="suffix"> / month</span></div>
    <div class="price-onetime">depending on Step 2</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Everything in Good, plus bi-weekly software updates, performance optimization, and a monthly health report so you always know what is happening.</li>
      <li>About 9 to 13 pooled hours per month for active page work, copy, images, content updates.</li>
      <li>The level most clients land on. The price jump from Good buys real visibility into your sites and disproportionate value.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tier" data-tier="best">
    <h3>Best</h3>
    <div class="tagline">Weekly updates. Same-day priority response.</div>
    <div class="price-monthly">$1,164.60 &ndash; $1,682.20<span class="suffix"> / month</span></div>
    <div class="price-onetime">depending on Step 2</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Everything in Better, plus weekly updates and same-day priority response when something breaks.</li>
      <li>About 14 to 21 pooled hours per month, depending on Step 2.</li>
      <li>One staff training session per quarter for your team, on whichever topic helps them most.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>

<h2>Step 2: Pick your site setup</h2>

<p id="step2-prompt" class="addon-prompt">Pick a Web Management level above and the two site-setup options will appear below.</p>

<div class="addon-choice" id="option-choice">
  <div class="addon-option" data-option="o1">
    <h3>Option 1: Single unified site</h3>
    <p>One Raised Bar Builders site, with Tailwater built in as a focused section. Default rollout, Tailwater launches first inside the build, and after the three homes sell the Tailwater section becomes a permanent portfolio piece. Two sites managed: Builders and the F3 Properties takeover.</p>
    <div class="addon-pricing">
      <p class="addon-price-line"><span id="o1-monthly">$894.60</span> / month</p>
      <p class="addon-price-detail">Builders site build: $5,625. F3 takeover onboarding: $800. Web Management onboarding: <span id="o1-onb">$800</span>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="addon-option" data-option="o2">
    <h3>Option 2: Split setup</h3>
    <p>Standalone Tailwater micro-site at its own URL for the parcel signage, ads, and a focused pre-sell funnel, plus the Raised Bar Builders site (without the Tailwater section), plus the F3 takeover. Three sites managed. After the three homes sell, the micro-site winds down and your monthly returns to the Option 1 number.</p>
    <div class="addon-pricing">
      <p class="addon-price-line"><span id="o2-monthly">$1,292.20</span> / month</p>
      <p class="addon-price-detail">Adds Tailwater micro-site build $4,500 and a small multi-site onboarding addition (<span id="o2-extra-onb">$200</span>).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Step 3: Add Marketing Consulting?</h2>

<p id="step3-prompt" class="addon-prompt">Pick a site setup above and the consulting choice will appear below.</p>

<div class="addon-choice" id="consulting-choice">
  <div class="addon-option" data-consulting="no">
    <h3>Web Management only</h3>
    <p>Skip Marketing Consulting for now. You can add it later at any time. The recurring stays at your management number from Step 2. Nothing changes about the sites or how I run them.</p>
    <div class="addon-pricing">
      <p class="addon-price-line">No additional charge</p>
      <p class="addon-price-detail">Mgmt-only monthly.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="addon-option" data-consulting="yes">
    <h3>Add Marketing Consulting</h3>
    <p>Research and strategy applied to the whole family of companies. Competitive analysis, search and content direction, brand positioning. I never execute on the marketing side. You give me direction, I come back with strategy. Sold once for the business, not per site.</p>
    <div class="addon-pricing">
      <p class="addon-price-line">+$497 to +$1,497 / month</p>
      <p class="addon-price-detail">Pick a level next. Audit at signing ranges $1,500 to $4,000 by level.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 id="consulting-step-h2" class="step-hidden">Step 4: Pick a Consulting level</h2>

<p id="step4-prompt" class="addon-prompt step-hidden">Choose Good, Better, or Best for the consulting engagement.</p>

<div class="tiers tiers-hidden" id="consulting-tiers">

  <div class="tier" data-consulting-tier="good">
    <h3>Good</h3>
    <div class="tagline">The lightest consulting engagement.</div>
    <div class="price-monthly">$497<span class="suffix"> / month</span></div>
    <div class="price-onetime">$1,500 audit at signing</div>
    <ul>
      <li>A baseline competitive and keyword read at the start of the engagement.</li>
      <li>Monthly access to my strategic thinking if you have a question. No ongoing roadmap, no monthly strategy call.</li>
      <li>Designed to get you in the door. Most clients move up after a few months because they want the cycle.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tier recommended" data-consulting-tier="better">
    <div class="pill">Recommended</div>
    <h3>Better</h3>
    <div class="tagline">The flagship consulting cycle.</div>
    <div class="price-monthly">$997<span class="suffix"> / month</span></div>
    <div class="price-onetime">$2,500 audit at signing</div>
    <ul>
      <li>A research-grade audit at the start, then a quarterly cycle of competitive analysis, SEO and content roadmap, and brand positioning.</li>
      <li>A 30-minute monthly strategy call. Quarterly performance reporting.</li>
      <li>This is the cycle for a business that is actually trying to grow.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tier" data-consulting-tier="best">
    <h3>Best</h3>
    <div class="tagline">Monthly strategy cycle. Hiring guidance included.</div>
    <div class="price-monthly">$1,497<span class="suffix"> / month</span></div>
    <div class="price-onetime">$4,000 audit at signing</div>
    <ul>
      <li>The deepest audit at the start, then a monthly cycle of competitive analysis, SEO and content roadmap, and ongoing brand work.</li>
      <li>A 60-minute strategy call every month. Monthly performance reporting.</li>
      <li>Hiring guidance when you bring marketing or web roles in-house. One staff training session per quarter for your team.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>

<h2>How it rolls out</h2>

<p>If you pick <strong>Option 1</strong> in Step 2:</p>

<div class="phase">
  <div class="phase-num">Phase 1</div>
  <h3>The unified Builders site, Tailwater section first</h3>
  <p>Marketing Consulting research starts the day this engagement signs (if you picked it). I build the unified Raised Bar Builders site with the Tailwater section completed first so the pre-sell launches while the rest of the builder content is still being finished. The ZipKit Homes authorized builder-dealer funnel and your About page (heritage, magazine feature, General's endorsement) land in the same launch. The site moves onto Web Management at launch.</p>
</div>

<div class="phase">
  <div class="phase-num">Phase 2</div>
  <h3>F3 Properties takeover</h3>
  <p>I take over F3, fix the broken styling, surface the magazine feature and General's endorsement properly, and tighten the site inside your monthly pooled hours. F3 joins the management pool as the second site.</p>
</div>

<p>If you pick <strong>Option 2</strong>, the order shifts: Phase 1 is the standalone Tailwater micro-site (built and launched first, on its own URL, for the pre-sell), Phase 2 is the Raised Bar Builders site without the Tailwater section, Phase 3 is the F3 takeover. The micro-site winds down after the three homes sell.</p>

<div class="close">

<h2>Sign and send</h2>

<p>This acceptance starts the work. I send the first invoice and begin Marketing Consulting research the same day you send this in. Formal contracts follow within the week with the full legal terms. This send is enough to get us moving.</p>

<div class="proposal-form" id="proposal-form-container">
  <div class="form-summary">
    <div class="summary-row">
      <span class="summary-label">Web Management level</span>
      <span class="summary-value" id="summary-tier">Pick above</span>
    </div>
    <div class="summary-row">
      <span class="summary-label">Site setup</span>
      <span class="summary-value" id="summary-option">Pick above</span>
    </div>
    <div class="summary-row">
      <span class="summary-label">Marketing Consulting</span>
      <span class="summary-value" id="summary-consulting">Pick above</span>
    </div>
    <div class="summary-row totals">
      <span class="summary-label">One-time at signing</span>
      <span class="summary-value" id="summary-onetime">&mdash;</span>
    </div>
    <div class="summary-row totals">
      <span class="summary-label">Monthly recurring</span>
      <span class="summary-value" id="summary-monthly">&mdash;</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-fields">
    <label class="field-label">
      Jason Roth, signing as
      <input type="text" id="jason-name" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Type your full name" />
    </label>
    <label class="field-label">
      Kevin Adams, signing as
      <input type="text" id="kevin-name" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Type your full name" />
    </label>
  </div>

  <button id="send-proposal" type="button" class="send-button" disabled>
    Send to Cody
  </button>

  <p class="form-note">
    Walk through the four steps above, then type both your names. Send routes a confirmation to you both and a notification to Cody. Formal contracts and the first invoice follow within the week.
  </p>
</div>

</div>

<footer>
Cody Smith, Cody A Smith LLC. <a href="mailto:cody@codyasmith.com">cody@codyasmith.com</a>. <a href="https://codyasmith.com">codyasmith.com</a>. Prepared May 22, 2026 for Jason Roth and Kevin Adams.
</footer>

</div>

<script is:inline>
(function() {
  // Pricing constants tracking business-design-v2: Web Management is
  // Ecosystem A (under 30 pages); the Raised Bar Builders build is one
  // Small build at $5,625. F3 takeover onboarding is a flat $800
  // (heavier than a standard multi-site addition because of the audit
  // work). The Tailwater micro-site, when present, is an additional
  // managed site that takes the 0.80 per-site floor. Marketing
  // Consulting is Ecosystem B (Growing/Regional, $1M-$10M).
  var MGMT_TIERS = {
    good:   { name: 'Good',   base: 297,  onb: 800,  hoursBase: 3 },
    better: { name: 'Better', base: 497,  onb: 800,  hoursBase: 5 },
    best:   { name: 'Best',   base: 647,  onb: 1000, hoursBase: 8 }
  };
  var CONSULTING_TIERS = {
    good:   { name: 'Good',   monthly: 497,  audit: 1500 },
    better: { name: 'Better', monthly: 997,  audit: 2500 },
    best:   { name: 'Best',   monthly: 1497, audit: 4000 }
  };
  var BUILD_BUILDERS = 5625;
  var BUILD_TAILWATER = 4500;
  var F3_ONBOARDING = 800;

  var state = {
    mgmtTier: null,
    option: null,
    consulting: null,
    consultingTier: null
  };

  function money(n) {
    return '$' + n.toLocaleString('en-US', { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });
  }
  function moneyInt(n) {
    return '$' + n.toLocaleString('en-US', { minimumFractionDigits: 0, maximumFractionDigits: 0 });
  }

  function mgmtMonthly(tier, option) {
    if (!tier) return 0;
    var base = MGMT_TIERS[tier].base;
    var sites = option === 'o2' ? 3 : 2;
    return base + (sites - 1) * base * 0.80;
  }
  function mgmtMultiSiteExtraOnb(tier, option) {
    if (option !== 'o2') return 0;
    return MGMT_TIERS[tier].onb * 0.25;
  }
  function oneTimeBreakdown() {
    var rows = [];
    if (state.mgmtTier && state.option) {
      var mgmtOnb = MGMT_TIERS[state.mgmtTier].onb;
      rows.push(['Builders site build', BUILD_BUILDERS]);
      rows.push(['Builders Web Management onboarding', mgmtOnb]);
      rows.push(['F3 Properties takeover onboarding', F3_ONBOARDING]);
      if (state.option === 'o2') {
        rows.push(['Tailwater micro-site build', BUILD_TAILWATER]);
        rows.push(['Tailwater multi-site onboarding addition', mgmtMultiSiteExtraOnb(state.mgmtTier, state.option)]);
      }
      if (state.consulting === 'yes' && state.consultingTier) {
        rows.push(['Marketing Consulting initial audit', CONSULTING_TIERS[state.consultingTier].audit]);
      }
    }
    return rows;
  }
  function oneTimeTotal() {
    return oneTimeBreakdown().reduce(function(s, r) { return s + r[1]; }, 0);
  }
  function monthlyTotal() {
    var m = mgmtMonthly(state.mgmtTier, state.option);
    if (state.consulting === 'yes' && state.consultingTier) {
      m += CONSULTING_TIERS[state.consultingTier].monthly;
    }
    return m;
  }
  function complete() {
    if (!state.mgmtTier || !state.option) return false;
    if (state.consulting === 'no') return true;
    if (state.consulting === 'yes' && state.consultingTier) return true;
    return false;
  }

  function update() {
    // Mgmt tier highlight
    var tierCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-tier]');
    for (var i = 0; i < tierCards.length; i++) {
      var t = tierCards[i].getAttribute('data-tier');
      tierCards[i].classList.toggle('selected', t === state.mgmtTier);
    }

    // Reveal Step 2 (option) when mgmt tier picked
    var optionChoice = document.getElementById('option-choice');
    var step2Prompt = document.getElementById('step2-prompt');
    if (state.mgmtTier) {
      if (optionChoice) optionChoice.classList.add('revealed');
      if (step2Prompt) step2Prompt.style.display = 'none';
      // Update o1/o2 prices for selected tier
      var o1mEl = document.getElementById('o1-monthly');
      var o2mEl = document.getElementById('o2-monthly');
      var o1onbEl = document.getElementById('o1-onb');
      var o2extraEl = document.getElementById('o2-extra-onb');
      if (o1mEl) o1mEl.textContent = money(mgmtMonthly(state.mgmtTier, 'o1'));
      if (o2mEl) o2mEl.textContent = money(mgmtMonthly(state.mgmtTier, 'o2'));
      if (o1onbEl) o1onbEl.textContent = moneyInt(MGMT_TIERS[state.mgmtTier].onb);
      if (o2extraEl) o2extraEl.textContent = moneyInt(MGMT_TIERS[state.mgmtTier].onb * 0.25);
    } else {
      if (optionChoice) optionChoice.classList.remove('revealed');
      if (step2Prompt) step2Prompt.style.display = '';
    }

    // Option highlight
    var optionCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-option]');
    for (var j = 0; j < optionCards.length; j++) {
      var o = optionCards[j].getAttribute('data-option');
      optionCards[j].classList.toggle('selected', o === state.option);
    }

    // Reveal Step 3 (consulting) when option picked
    var consultingChoice = document.getElementById('consulting-choice');
    var step3Prompt = document.getElementById('step3-prompt');
    if (state.option) {
      if (consultingChoice) consultingChoice.classList.add('revealed');
      if (step3Prompt) step3Prompt.style.display = 'none';
    } else {
      if (consultingChoice) consultingChoice.classList.remove('revealed');
      if (step3Prompt) step3Prompt.style.display = '';
    }

    // Consulting yes/no highlight
    var consultingCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-consulting]');
    for (var k = 0; k < consultingCards.length; k++) {
      var c = consultingCards[k].getAttribute('data-consulting');
      consultingCards[k].classList.toggle('selected', c === state.consulting);
    }

    // Reveal Step 4 (consulting tier) when consulting=yes
    var consultingH2 = document.getElementById('consulting-step-h2');
    var step4Prompt = document.getElementById('step4-prompt');
    var consultingTiers = document.getElementById('consulting-tiers');
    if (state.consulting === 'yes') {
      if (consultingH2) consultingH2.classList.remove('step-hidden');
      if (step4Prompt) step4Prompt.classList.remove('step-hidden');
      if (consultingTiers) consultingTiers.classList.add('revealed');
    } else {
      if (consultingH2) consultingH2.classList.add('step-hidden');
      if (step4Prompt) step4Prompt.classList.add('step-hidden');
      if (consultingTiers) consultingTiers.classList.remove('revealed');
      // Clear consulting tier selection if user toggled to 'no'
      if (state.consulting === 'no') state.consultingTier = null;
    }

    // Consulting tier highlight
    var consultingTierCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-consulting-tier]');
    for (var n = 0; n < consultingTierCards.length; n++) {
      var ct = consultingTierCards[n].getAttribute('data-consulting-tier');
      consultingTierCards[n].classList.toggle('selected', ct === state.consultingTier);
    }

    // Form summary. Each block guards on its own element existing so a
    // single missing node does not abort the entire update chain.
    function setSummary(id, text, isSelected) {
      var el = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!el) return;
      el.textContent = text;
      el.classList.toggle('selected', !!isSelected);
    }

    setSummary('summary-tier',
      state.mgmtTier ? MGMT_TIERS[state.mgmtTier].name : 'Pick above',
      !!state.mgmtTier);

    if (state.option === 'o1') {
      setSummary('summary-option', 'Option 1: Single unified site', true);
    } else if (state.option === 'o2') {
      setSummary('summary-option', 'Option 2: Split setup (with micro-site)', true);
    } else {
      setSummary('summary-option', 'Pick above', false);
    }

    if (state.consulting === 'no') {
      setSummary('summary-consulting', 'Skipped', true);
    } else if (state.consulting === 'yes' && state.consultingTier) {
      setSummary('summary-consulting', 'Yes, ' + CONSULTING_TIERS[state.consultingTier].name, true);
    } else if (state.consulting === 'yes') {
      setSummary('summary-consulting', 'Yes, pick a level above', false);
    } else {
      setSummary('summary-consulting', 'Pick above', false);
    }

    if (complete()) {
      setSummary('summary-onetime', moneyInt(oneTimeTotal()), true);
      setSummary('summary-monthly', money(monthlyTotal()) + ' / month', true);
    } else {
      setSummary('summary-onetime', '—', false);
      setSummary('summary-monthly', '—', false);
    }

    // Send button enable
    var jasonInput = document.getElementById('jason-name');
    var kevinInput = document.getElementById('kevin-name');
    var jasonName = jasonInput ? jasonInput.value.trim() : '';
    var kevinName = kevinInput ? kevinInput.value.trim() : '';
    var sendBtn = document.getElementById('send-proposal');
    var canSend = !!(complete() && jasonName && kevinName);
    if (sendBtn) sendBtn.disabled = !canSend;
  }

  function scrollTo(id) {
    var target = document.getElementById(id);
    if (target) setTimeout(function() { target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }, 140);
  }

  // Wire up mgmt tier cards
  var tierCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-tier]');
  for (var ti = 0; ti < tierCards.length; ti++) {
    (function(card) {
      card.addEventListener('click', function() {
        state.mgmtTier = card.getAttribute('data-tier');
        update();
        if (!state.option) scrollTo('option-choice');
      });
    })(tierCards[ti]);
  }

  // Wire up option (o1/o2) cards
  var optionCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-option]');
  for (var oi = 0; oi < optionCards.length; oi++) {
    (function(card) {
      card.addEventListener('click', function() {
        state.option = card.getAttribute('data-option');
        update();
        if (!state.consulting) scrollTo('consulting-choice');
      });
    })(optionCards[oi]);
  }

  // Wire up consulting yes/no cards
  var consultingCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-consulting]');
  for (var ci = 0; ci < consultingCards.length; ci++) {
    (function(card) {
      card.addEventListener('click', function() {
        state.consulting = card.getAttribute('data-consulting');
        update();
        if (state.consulting === 'yes' && !state.consultingTier) scrollTo('consulting-tiers');
        else if (state.consulting === 'no') scrollTo('proposal-form-container');
      });
    })(consultingCards[ci]);
  }

  // Wire up consulting tier cards
  var consultingTierCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-consulting-tier]');
  for (var cti = 0; cti < consultingTierCards.length; cti++) {
    (function(card) {
      card.addEventListener('click', function() {
        state.consultingTier = card.getAttribute('data-consulting-tier');
        update();
        scrollTo('proposal-form-container');
      });
    })(consultingTierCards[cti]);
  }

  // Wire up name inputs
  var inputIds = ['jason-name', 'kevin-name'];
  for (var ii = 0; ii < inputIds.length; ii++) {
    var el = document.getElementById(inputIds[ii]);
    if (el) el.addEventListener('input', update);
  }

  // Wire up send
  var sendBtn = document.getElementById('send-proposal');
  if (sendBtn) {
    sendBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      sendBtn.disabled = true;
      sendBtn.textContent = 'Sending...';
      var csrf = document.querySelector('meta[name="csrf-token"]');
      var csrfToken = csrf ? csrf.getAttribute('content') : '';
      var jasonName = document.getElementById('jason-name').value.trim();
      var kevinName = document.getElementById('kevin-name').value.trim();
      fetch('/portal/api/proposals/raised-bar/accept', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'X-CSRF-Token': csrfToken || '' },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          mgmt_tier: state.mgmtTier,
          option: state.option,
          consulting: state.consulting,
          consulting_tier: state.consultingTier,
          jason_name: jasonName,
          kevin_name: kevinName
        })
      }).then(function(res) {
        return res.json().then(function(data) { return { ok: res.ok, data: data }; });
      }).then(function(result) {
        if (result.ok) {
          var container = document.getElementById('proposal-form-container');
          var emails = (result.data && result.data.confirmation_emails) || 'you both';
          container.innerHTML =
            '<div class="success-message">' +
              '<h3>Got it. Engagement accepted.</h3>' +
              '<p>I will send the formal contracts and the first invoice in the next few days. Reach me at <a href="mailto:cody@codyasmith.com">cody@codyasmith.com</a> or call or text any time with questions.</p>' +
              '<p class="success-note">Confirmation sent to ' + emails + '.</p>' +
            '</div>';
          window.scrollTo({ top: container.offsetTop - 32, behavior: 'smooth' });
        } else {
          sendBtn.disabled = false;
          sendBtn.textContent = 'Send to Cody';
          var msg = (result.data && result.data.error) || 'Send failed. Email cody@codyasmith.com directly if this keeps happening.';
          alert(msg);
        }
      }).catch(function() {
        sendBtn.disabled = false;
        sendBtn.textContent = 'Send to Cody';
        alert('Connection error. Try again or email cody@codyasmith.com.');
      });
    });
  }

  update();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
